WEBVTT

00:12.595 --> 00:15.432
We now begin our operation
to arrest the suspects

00:15.515 --> 00:18.768
and retrieve the firearms
still in the gang's possession.

00:18.852 --> 00:21.896
Special Ops and I will be
at the main source. We'll be at the club.

00:21.980 --> 00:24.232
Officer Lee will raid
the apartment complex

00:24.315 --> 00:26.067
and retrieve the rest of the firearms.

00:26.151 --> 00:28.153
Regarding the apartment complex,

00:28.236 --> 00:31.489
can't we order the Special Ops unit
just to rush in and outnumber them all?

00:32.073 --> 00:34.117
It's too risky for a few reasons.

00:34.200 --> 00:36.786
This is a large complex
in a highly populated area.

00:36.870 --> 00:38.204
There's a commercial sector

00:38.288 --> 00:40.665
as well as a subway station
in the vicinity.

00:40.749 --> 00:43.084
With the citizens
already anxious about guns,

00:43.168 --> 00:44.544
I think a large-scale shootout

00:44.627 --> 00:47.756
would only bring
widespread panic and confusion.

00:49.049 --> 00:52.427
As you all know,
this operation must be handled carefully

00:53.094 --> 00:54.679
and quicker than usual.

00:54.763 --> 00:57.974
How can we trust
that Seok-ho will cooperate in good faith?

00:58.058 --> 01:00.310
Could it be
that he's got some ulterior motive?

01:00.393 --> 01:01.811
We're prepared for that.

01:01.895 --> 01:04.773
Once we arrest Seok-ho
and Jeong-man at the club,

01:05.356 --> 01:07.984
Officer Lee will then enter
the apartment complex.

01:08.485 --> 01:11.237
First, let me confiscate all the guns
in Jeong-man's hideout

01:11.321 --> 01:12.906
and see where it goes from there.

01:12.989 --> 01:15.325
All right.
Bring the suspects here by tomorrow.

01:16.076 --> 01:17.827
Come on, guys! Let's go!

01:36.638 --> 01:40.475
GYEONGIN SEOBU POLICE STATION

01:46.189 --> 01:47.941
- Come on, hurry up!
- I got it.

01:48.441 --> 01:50.777
- You get it all in?
- Yeah.

01:52.529 --> 01:53.404
Follow them.

02:02.789 --> 02:05.458
All units,
stand by until Jeong-man arrives.

02:27.063 --> 02:28.022
Officer Lee?

02:28.773 --> 02:30.108
We're good on our end.

02:30.191 --> 02:31.818
Jeong-man hasn't arrived yet.

02:32.360 --> 02:33.862
We'll call you when he's here.

02:34.654 --> 02:35.530
YAKAM TOURIST HOTEL

02:36.489 --> 02:39.409
What are those dirtbags doing in there
that's taking so long?

02:50.670 --> 02:51.880
How are your fingers?

02:52.922 --> 02:54.090
All good. See?

02:54.632 --> 02:56.968
I even put cream on
so they're soft and supple.

02:57.510 --> 02:58.428
Put it on.

02:58.928 --> 03:00.972
It'll only fool him for a second or two.

03:01.556 --> 03:02.765
Give him my regards

03:03.349 --> 03:06.227
Oh yeah, I'll make sure. Believe me.

03:40.762 --> 03:42.347
Shit! The fuck was that?!

03:42.430 --> 03:43.306
Hey.

03:45.183 --> 03:46.726
How do you like this thing?

03:47.560 --> 03:48.811
Huge, right?

03:48.895 --> 03:50.730
What the--

03:54.776 --> 03:55.777
Jeong-man! Jeong-man!

03:55.860 --> 03:59.197
Jeong-man!
Listen to me now! We can talk about this!

04:34.190 --> 04:36.567
Jeong-man's car is approaching.
Vehicle arriving.

04:37.819 --> 04:38.695
He's here.

04:39.862 --> 04:42.907
Everyone, check your firearms
and bulletproof vests.

04:42.991 --> 04:44.242
Be on your guard.

04:50.248 --> 04:51.249
You ready?

04:55.878 --> 04:57.005
Listen.

04:57.714 --> 04:59.382
If I make it out of here alive,

05:00.383 --> 05:01.968
I'll take you somewhere nice, okay?

05:02.593 --> 05:03.553
And if not?

05:03.636 --> 05:04.846
If not…

05:07.140 --> 05:09.809
…Jeong-man will treat you. Wish me luck.

05:13.062 --> 05:14.147
Huh?

05:31.164 --> 05:32.915
Well, come on in.

05:42.759 --> 05:46.596
I bet you're surprised, Gong,
you stupid fucking bitch. Huh?

05:47.263 --> 05:49.974
You wanted these guys, right?
Huh? You see? Say hello!

05:52.352 --> 05:54.771
Ah shit.

05:54.854 --> 05:57.106
You tried burying me
in the middle of nowhere.

05:57.190 --> 06:00.902
And now Jeong-man is burying you.
Isn't that ironic? Huh?

06:04.113 --> 06:06.866
Shots fired in building.
Shots fired in building.

06:06.949 --> 06:08.785
Special Ops, mobilize.

06:08.868 --> 06:11.788
In teams of two,
conduct a full sweep of the building.

06:21.923 --> 06:23.883
Jeong-man, you bitch!

06:23.966 --> 06:27.470
Fucking hell, you scared me.
What are you yelling at me for?

06:27.553 --> 06:28.554
Hello?

06:29.514 --> 06:31.057
You get those fingers you wanted?

06:32.266 --> 06:33.309
Where the hell are you?

06:33.393 --> 06:35.144
That's not important right now.

06:35.770 --> 06:37.939
Did you finally meet Mr. Kim's ghost?

06:40.400 --> 06:42.735
It's not my business
where all this cash came from.

06:44.654 --> 06:47.865
But consider it as a payment in full
for all those jobs we did.

06:47.949 --> 06:50.743
- What?
- Oh, and I'm really sorry.

06:50.827 --> 06:52.328
But you know those cigars?

06:52.412 --> 06:53.538
The Cubans?

06:55.289 --> 06:58.042
To be honest,
they don't really suit you at all.

06:58.126 --> 06:59.877
Jeong-man,

07:01.045 --> 07:03.297
after everything I did for you…

07:09.011 --> 07:11.639
Says the bastard
who sold me out to the police.

07:12.140 --> 07:14.600
Eat shit, motherfucker!

07:36.414 --> 07:37.498
Let's go.

07:40.626 --> 07:42.295
Please!

07:47.800 --> 07:50.553
Stop shooting, god dammit.

07:53.389 --> 07:55.516
Shut up and die, prick.

08:23.544 --> 08:25.463
What the… This isn't Jeong-man.

08:26.130 --> 08:27.215
It's Mr. Kim.

08:29.967 --> 08:31.344
What are you talking about?

08:31.427 --> 08:32.345
Where's Jeong-man?

08:32.428 --> 08:35.473
He's most likely
headed in your direction, sir.

08:35.556 --> 08:37.391
All right, leave it up to me.

09:08.422 --> 09:10.341
Stand by until I give the signal.

09:10.424 --> 09:11.759
Standing by. Waiting for signal.

09:18.057 --> 09:19.976
- Watch it.
- Don't forget your bag.

09:20.059 --> 09:22.019
Let's go.

09:27.400 --> 09:28.526
Boss, how'd it go?

09:29.151 --> 09:30.152
Listen up.

09:35.283 --> 09:37.618
- Holy shit! This is incredible.
- What's this?

09:37.702 --> 09:38.536
Now,

09:39.120 --> 09:41.581
this was a long time coming.
Divide it equally.

09:41.664 --> 09:45.626
Starting today, it's finally our turn.
Nothing but the best for my crew!

09:49.088 --> 09:50.131
Yes, fuck!

09:51.465 --> 09:52.592
Sweet, right?

09:52.675 --> 09:54.427
I can't believe this!

09:54.510 --> 09:56.512
Don't forget to grab your share too.
Get in there.

09:58.139 --> 10:00.391
- You have to get out of here. Hurry!
- Yes, sir.

10:21.912 --> 10:22.747
Jeong-man.

10:23.331 --> 10:25.291
Cops have totally stormed the place.

10:25.374 --> 10:27.293
Okay.

10:28.586 --> 10:29.837
Get over here quick.

11:00.534 --> 11:02.328
Hey. You got a light?

11:02.411 --> 11:03.621
Me? Nope.

11:03.704 --> 11:04.997
I'm gonna grab one from the car.

11:20.971 --> 11:22.807
- Someone's shooting!
- Go check outside!

11:22.890 --> 11:24.266
Shit. Are the cops here?

11:25.142 --> 11:28.229
Encountered a suspect.
Entering building. Prepare for engagement.

11:30.815 --> 11:32.775
- Clean this shit up!
- Let's go! Hurry up!

12:28.372 --> 12:29.373
Go.

12:57.902 --> 12:59.653
Shots fired in an apartment complex.

12:59.737 --> 13:02.198
If suspect is spotted,
use any force necessary.

13:05.659 --> 13:06.827
Turn now!

13:07.912 --> 13:08.913
Go faster!

13:17.505 --> 13:18.631
Bitch!

13:28.098 --> 13:29.099
Wake up.

13:29.725 --> 13:30.726
Keep driving.

13:32.520 --> 13:33.687
Chang-ju!

13:33.771 --> 13:34.772
Chang-ju!

13:42.947 --> 13:44.031
Jun-ho?

13:44.532 --> 13:46.325
Hey. Jun-ho!

13:46.408 --> 13:47.243
Jun-ho!

13:47.326 --> 13:48.702
Jun-ho, we need to go.

13:57.378 --> 13:58.379
Yeah.

13:58.462 --> 13:59.463
Jun-ho!

13:59.964 --> 14:00.965
Let's go!

14:28.742 --> 14:31.537
Location confirmed.
Suspect will be taken into custody.

14:51.974 --> 14:53.851
All the firearms used in recent shootings

14:53.934 --> 14:55.853
have been traced back
to the criminal organization

14:55.936 --> 14:58.022
whose members were arrested today.

14:58.522 --> 14:59.565
The police have stated

14:59.648 --> 15:01.358
that they would continue
to make every effort

15:01.442 --> 15:04.069
to find the remaining guns
that have not yet been recovered.

15:04.862 --> 15:07.781
The police have successfully rounded up
the organization responsible

15:07.865 --> 15:09.074
for distributing firearms.

15:10.534 --> 15:12.703
This is seriously happening right now?

15:14.413 --> 15:16.749
It's from Jake. You should answer.

15:17.791 --> 15:19.710
…knowing the organization responsible

15:19.793 --> 15:20.961
has been arrested.

15:21.754 --> 15:24.673
The guns were confiscated.
They're in police custody.

15:24.757 --> 15:27.718
If Korean Intelligence
starts sniffing around…

15:27.801 --> 15:29.178
You understand my concern.

15:29.678 --> 15:32.932
I don't like when things get messy.

15:33.682 --> 15:36.685
You know what's gonna happen
if the CIA sniffs this out.

15:36.769 --> 15:39.980
It won't just be Korea on the line.

15:40.064 --> 15:42.441
It'll be the end of our business!

15:42.524 --> 15:43.901
Understand?

15:43.984 --> 15:46.654
We won't let that happen, sir.
We'll clean it up.

15:47.988 --> 15:48.989
Wrap it up.

15:49.657 --> 15:50.741
And come home.

16:17.017 --> 16:18.018
Would you

16:18.852 --> 16:20.396
care to look yourself, sir?

16:43.627 --> 16:44.795
This is your daughter.

16:45.629 --> 16:46.630
Is that correct?

16:49.633 --> 16:50.551
That is…

16:58.308 --> 16:59.560
…that is not my daughter.

17:01.061 --> 17:01.979
Pardon, sir?

17:02.855 --> 17:04.690
I said that's not my daughter.

17:05.816 --> 17:07.526
I know it must be difficult.

17:08.652 --> 17:10.946
But could you please
take a closer look, sir?

17:32.801 --> 17:34.636
That is not my daughter.

17:46.607 --> 17:48.108
RECENT CALLS

17:58.077 --> 17:59.119
MY DAUGHTER

18:04.750 --> 18:05.751
Please pick up.

18:07.628 --> 18:09.421
I just need you to pick up.

18:09.505 --> 18:11.715
Hmm. So I see my daughter packed me

18:11.799 --> 18:14.635
another bland lunch today,
thinking I would be thankful.

18:14.718 --> 18:17.429
It's good for you.
It's important for you to stay healthy.

18:17.513 --> 18:18.972
Yeah! I know, I know.

18:19.056 --> 18:20.849
She told me she wants to move out.

18:20.933 --> 18:23.936
Something about her work-life balance or…

18:24.019 --> 18:27.356
But she wants to take out a loan
from the bank and start a lease.

18:27.439 --> 18:28.857
- Look who it is.
- Huh?

18:28.941 --> 18:29.858
Who's that?!

18:30.359 --> 18:32.319
Oh, look! It's my daughter, Se-yeong!

18:32.402 --> 18:33.612
My Se-yeong.

18:33.695 --> 18:35.447
- I told you to call them.
- I did call them.

18:35.531 --> 18:38.617
But I can't get ahold of anyone.
That's why I'm asking for your help.

18:38.700 --> 18:40.828
- Whatever. Forget it.
- The police aren't busy enough?

18:44.581 --> 18:45.666
Please answer.

18:46.708 --> 18:49.086
I miss you so much, Se-yeong.

19:17.614 --> 19:20.033
Of course, yes.
We'll… we'll look into that.

19:20.117 --> 19:22.369
- Evening, Inspector.
- What are you doing here?

19:22.452 --> 19:24.079
Just wanted to check something.

19:24.163 --> 19:25.330
- All right.
- Hello.

19:38.510 --> 19:40.929
Things are crazy out there
with all these guns.

19:41.013 --> 19:44.016
- You should be extra careful, okay?
- Yes. I will.

19:46.894 --> 19:48.228
You stay safe too, Inspector.

19:48.312 --> 19:50.063
- I'll keep in touch.
- Yeah, okay.

19:50.147 --> 19:52.024
- Good luck.
- Have a good night.

20:06.705 --> 20:07.831
Can I help you?

20:13.295 --> 20:15.547
Well, well. Sergeant Lee.

20:16.715 --> 20:17.716
Long time no see.

20:17.799 --> 20:19.259
So you're still alive.

20:19.760 --> 20:20.886
It's good to see you.

20:23.013 --> 20:25.224
Don't think
just because you saved my ass once

20:25.307 --> 20:27.309
gets you off the hook. Understood?

20:27.809 --> 20:30.437
After all that time we spent
fighting together on the battlefield,

20:30.520 --> 20:34.149
it's not right you only visit
when you need a favor. Hurts my feelings.

20:34.233 --> 20:35.150
Hmm?

20:37.527 --> 20:39.112
I've been meaning to come.

20:39.196 --> 20:40.113
Yeah.

20:40.822 --> 20:44.117
Maybe one day you can take me out
to a movie and dancing, you know?

20:44.201 --> 20:47.788
Ah, never mind. I'm not much of a dancer.
Here, let me take a look at this.

20:50.165 --> 20:51.541
Wow, what's this?

20:52.960 --> 20:55.796
It was found in one of the guns
retrieved from the scene.

20:56.421 --> 20:59.299
Whoa.
This is a new state-of-the-art GPS device.

20:59.383 --> 21:02.427
This is impressive.
It even has wiretapping capabilities.

21:05.264 --> 21:07.099
So is it tapping us now?

21:07.182 --> 21:08.725
Mm-mm. Nah.

21:10.018 --> 21:13.480
This chip doesn't support tapping,
only tracking.

21:14.481 --> 21:16.692
Were there any other devices
aside from this?

21:19.569 --> 21:22.614
Other devices…
No. I… I don't think I saw any.

21:22.698 --> 21:24.449
Okay, so with this thing,

21:25.242 --> 21:27.369
you can only track locations.

21:27.452 --> 21:31.123
You'd need another assistive device
to enable the wiretapping.

21:34.084 --> 21:35.627
"An assistive device"?

21:36.295 --> 21:38.005
You have to look deeper.

21:38.088 --> 21:40.882
There must be something obvious
that you're missing.

21:55.772 --> 21:58.608
In the past few years,
there's been a massive influx

21:58.692 --> 22:01.903
of illegal firearms
into areas of civil and interstate war.

22:01.987 --> 22:06.658
The CIA conducted
and finally determined that

22:06.742 --> 22:08.994
the organization behind these incidents

22:09.077 --> 22:10.954
was the International Rifle Union.

22:11.038 --> 22:14.166
The IRU primarily operates
on the black market,

22:14.249 --> 22:18.086
massively involved in the illegal sales
and distribution of weapons

22:18.170 --> 22:20.547
to groups
that can't obtain them otherwise.

22:20.630 --> 22:22.215
Through legal channels,

22:23.008 --> 22:26.845
we know that they hold an immense power.

22:26.928 --> 22:30.557
A major force lobbying for US politicians
and global corporations,

22:30.640 --> 22:32.351
making them practically untouchable.

22:34.144 --> 22:35.270
This is Blue Brown.

22:36.229 --> 22:38.899
He's been identified as the person
in charge of overseeing

22:38.982 --> 22:41.777
and managing
all distributional aspects of firearms

22:41.860 --> 22:43.779
currently taking place here
in South Korea.

22:43.862 --> 22:46.281
How many guns
have been brought into the country so far?

22:46.782 --> 22:49.618
The current number…
is approximately 30,000.

22:49.701 --> 22:51.828
What? Did you say 30,000?

22:51.912 --> 22:54.247
Investigations revealed
no actual couriers were used

22:54.331 --> 22:57.501
during the incidents
involving Jeong-tae and Won-seong.

22:57.584 --> 22:58.752
While we're working to trace

22:58.835 --> 23:01.463
where and how these firearms
were stored and distributed,

23:01.546 --> 23:03.632
it's still proving to be very difficult.

23:05.217 --> 23:08.011
Even if it started with smuggling them in,

23:09.096 --> 23:09.930
it's not possible

23:10.013 --> 23:12.641
they scattered all those guns
across the country without couriers.

23:33.495 --> 23:35.831
So this is where you were hiding out.

23:39.126 --> 23:40.043
Now,

23:40.544 --> 23:43.380
who said you could leave
the nurses' station without my say?!

23:44.840 --> 23:45.841
I'm so sorry.

23:46.591 --> 23:48.510
My shift was almost over.

23:49.719 --> 23:51.138
I haven't been home this week,

23:51.221 --> 23:55.058
and I wanted to at least…
grab some clean socks from home.

23:57.310 --> 23:58.979
Just wash the ones you have on.

23:59.563 --> 24:01.481
Don't think you're anything special.

24:02.149 --> 24:04.192
I just got in trouble because of you.

24:04.985 --> 24:06.778
Go wipe down all the IV poles

24:06.862 --> 24:09.406
and change the patient's dressings
right now.

24:09.489 --> 24:10.323
I don't know why,

24:10.407 --> 24:13.201
but every single thing you do
pisses me off.

24:13.952 --> 24:16.788
If you're stupid,
the least you can do is work a bit harder.

24:16.872 --> 24:19.458
Come on, Nurse Yu-jin.
Let's just leave her.

24:19.958 --> 24:22.043
Fucking bitch.

24:22.127 --> 24:24.546
Just looking at her face
makes me want to smash it.

24:25.046 --> 24:27.048
I just can't stand her.

25:08.089 --> 25:08.965
Hey there.

25:13.678 --> 25:15.138
If everyone had a gun,

25:15.222 --> 25:17.224
what would that mean to Korea?

25:17.849 --> 25:18.683
What?

25:19.601 --> 25:20.852
Aren't you curious?

25:21.561 --> 25:24.022
I'm… not sure what you mean.

25:28.318 --> 25:31.821
What provokes anger the most in people
is other people.

25:32.781 --> 25:33.907
Selfish people.

25:34.699 --> 25:36.284
But the strange thing is,

25:37.911 --> 25:39.996
when you have one of these in your hand…

25:41.748 --> 25:43.124
…it changes the rules.

25:44.334 --> 25:45.544
"The rules"?

25:46.962 --> 25:50.340
You're saying you wanna change
the rules of the world with guns?

25:50.423 --> 25:51.258
Mm-hmm.

25:51.758 --> 25:53.343
You can't really think that--

25:59.641 --> 26:01.685
Do you know the real power of a gun?

26:03.645 --> 26:05.272
It's an easy thing,

26:06.022 --> 26:08.775
pulling this little 5-millimeter trigger.

26:10.986 --> 26:13.989
Sends a sound
that travels over 500 meters away.

26:14.823 --> 26:17.576
It's a sound
that travels deep into people's fear.

26:19.494 --> 26:21.288
And you and I don't matter.

26:22.205 --> 26:24.124
It provokes a reaction.

26:24.749 --> 26:27.335
And that reaction provokes
another and another.

26:27.919 --> 26:30.130
You get a hundred people
pulling the trigger…

26:34.884 --> 26:36.219
or a thousand people…

26:38.471 --> 26:40.056
what do you think happens then?

26:42.309 --> 26:43.602
In the blink of an eye…

26:44.102 --> 26:45.061
Swah!

26:47.480 --> 26:50.150
And eventually,
all that fear will give way

26:50.984 --> 26:52.694
to a new world order.

27:05.832 --> 27:09.794
To approach the people of Korea,
you have to understand their emotions.

27:09.878 --> 27:12.756
The victims are always the first ones
to pull the trigger.

27:13.381 --> 27:15.759
Something we can all understand
at the end of it all.

27:16.843 --> 27:18.386
Despair is the key.

27:20.430 --> 27:22.140
So I ask you to do one thing.

27:22.891 --> 27:23.892
Just one.

27:25.477 --> 27:27.437
Get some footage of my beautiful guns,

27:28.313 --> 27:29.814
so that people can see

27:30.565 --> 27:32.150
how they can change everything.

27:34.694 --> 27:37.739
Who, exactly, are you in the service of?

27:42.327 --> 27:45.330
You and I both know
who we are isn't important.

27:48.249 --> 27:50.877
What is important is what happens next.

27:53.880 --> 27:57.342
That answer will completely change
the world as we know it.

28:09.896 --> 28:11.606
If my guess is right,

28:12.941 --> 28:15.860
there's a chip like this
in each of those guns.

28:15.944 --> 28:18.738
That's how everyone who has them
is being monitored.

28:21.324 --> 28:22.575
So the big question is…

28:22.659 --> 28:23.535
hmm…

28:24.119 --> 28:26.287
…what is this assistive device?

28:34.379 --> 28:35.964
- Hello?
- Hey, it's Lee.

28:36.464 --> 28:37.549
Aside from the address list,

28:37.632 --> 28:40.093
did the shooters have anything else
in common, do you know?

28:41.344 --> 28:43.930
Nothing
except their cell phones being hacked.

28:44.472 --> 28:45.473
Cell phones?

28:53.815 --> 28:57.527
Sir, this is Officer Lee.
He was my superior in the military.

28:59.446 --> 29:02.073
Officer Lee,
once the IRU selects a target,

29:02.157 --> 29:04.200
they normally leave behind bullets.

29:04.284 --> 29:06.786
That marks the beginnings
of their operations.

29:07.829 --> 29:10.957
It's a signal that they'll eventually
distribute guns in that area

29:11.040 --> 29:12.083
Listen to me.

29:12.959 --> 29:14.586
Prior to the gosiwon shootings,

29:15.086 --> 29:17.380
you found bullets at a nearby house.

29:18.006 --> 29:20.133
I'm sure you remember that.

29:20.216 --> 29:22.260
Detective Seo! Detective!

29:25.096 --> 29:26.598
This was found on his body?

29:26.681 --> 29:28.558
It's obvious
these rounds haven't been reported.

29:29.142 --> 29:30.810
What did the deceased do for work?

29:30.894 --> 29:35.231
The deceased had a criminal record.
It seems that he sold children for money.

29:35.315 --> 29:38.359
He sold them to foreigners
about 20 to 30 years ago.

29:43.323 --> 29:44.157
What do you want?

29:44.741 --> 29:45.867
It's been a while.

29:47.994 --> 29:48.912
What?

29:49.829 --> 29:50.830
Hey.

29:51.539 --> 29:52.957
I asked you what you want!

29:59.297 --> 30:00.799
You haven't changed at all.

30:01.758 --> 30:04.844
We're gonna make some money!

30:04.928 --> 30:07.222
Type AB…

30:07.806 --> 30:09.140
Let's see. Hey!

30:10.183 --> 30:12.560
Yeah, you. Come over here.

30:13.311 --> 30:14.145
Yeah.

30:21.361 --> 30:24.489
So the bullets
you found at that house were a signal

30:25.114 --> 30:26.658
that he will do whatever he can

30:26.741 --> 30:28.785
to take down
the country that abandoned him.

30:34.582 --> 30:37.794
He's someone
who wants to make his message very clear.

30:37.877 --> 30:41.422
And you're an important part in all this.
That's why he approached you.

30:43.591 --> 30:45.176
I'm not exactly sure.

30:49.681 --> 30:52.809
We found this embedded in
one of the guns Jeong-man was holding.

30:52.892 --> 30:56.938
GPS devices like this
were hidden in all the distributed guns.

30:58.314 --> 30:59.274
So they used these chips

30:59.357 --> 31:01.401
to track the locations
of people they gave guns to?

31:01.484 --> 31:04.404
That's right.
It's a state-of-the-art GPS monitor.

31:04.988 --> 31:07.907
Coupled with an assistive device,
they can track who gets what.

31:08.491 --> 31:11.452
If it can tap conversations,
I think we can reverse it.

31:11.536 --> 31:12.579
To the source?

31:12.662 --> 31:15.373
As you know,
from all the chips that we confiscated,

31:15.456 --> 31:18.418
we were able to pick up a signal
that was common to all of them.

31:18.501 --> 31:19.752
That's the source.

31:20.336 --> 31:22.714
That signal is the base
of the organization.

31:23.464 --> 31:25.383
That's a possibility.

31:25.466 --> 31:27.176
What? What's happening?

31:27.677 --> 31:29.053
- Huh?
- What's that?

31:29.637 --> 31:31.806
- What's going on?
- Is it… Blue Brown?

31:31.890 --> 31:33.808
What's he doing?

31:33.892 --> 31:36.394
- Main screen controls offline.
- Yes, understood.

31:36.477 --> 31:38.354
- Find out how he hacked us.
- On it.

31:38.438 --> 31:40.648
- Secure the server.
- Yes, will do.

31:40.732 --> 31:42.817
- It's not working.
- Too much traffic.

31:44.068 --> 31:45.570
Trace his IP address.

31:46.070 --> 31:47.655
Determining exact location.

31:50.533 --> 31:51.743
Trace the call now!

31:51.826 --> 31:54.537
Manager, looks like someone has a gun.

31:55.038 --> 31:57.874
Everyone, put your hands on your heads
and stand up!

31:58.458 --> 31:59.626
Stand up now!

32:00.418 --> 32:02.045
Everyone move to the back of the room.

32:02.545 --> 32:04.797
- Move. Quickly!
- Don't bring anything with you.

32:06.007 --> 32:07.884
Move towards the back. Quickly.

32:07.967 --> 32:09.093
So,

32:10.345 --> 32:12.555
aren't you happy to see me again,
my friend?

32:14.098 --> 32:16.476
Yeah. I knew you guys, uh,

32:17.602 --> 32:19.437
would find the chips eventually.

32:21.356 --> 32:23.191
But… 

32:24.025 --> 32:25.985
…that's not what's important right now.

32:29.238 --> 32:30.782
We have one secured.

32:33.451 --> 32:34.285
That gun…

32:37.080 --> 32:38.998
You think there aren't more than that?

32:40.458 --> 32:43.378
There are tons of people in Korea
who want guns.

32:44.003 --> 32:46.297
Here, there, everywhere.

32:48.007 --> 32:49.634
Especially at 27 Baekju-ro.

32:51.636 --> 32:52.720
27 Baekju-ro.

32:53.972 --> 32:57.183
There's someone
who's about to pull a trigger right now.

32:57.767 --> 32:59.060
This is 27 Baekju-ro.

32:59.143 --> 33:00.561
I'm just really curious

33:01.145 --> 33:03.272
what decision you'll make.

33:08.361 --> 33:09.779
Hurry up, my friend.

33:11.322 --> 33:12.865
There isn't much time left.

33:20.707 --> 33:21.624
Sergeant…

33:22.583 --> 33:25.712
This morning,
another scam victim took her own life.

33:26.212 --> 33:28.256
This is now the ninth reported case.

33:28.756 --> 33:31.175
Despite the victim's pleas
and desperate signals,

33:31.676 --> 33:35.430
the authorities are still being criticized
for being blind to this matter.

33:35.513 --> 33:38.433
Their vacuous measures
have led many families

33:38.516 --> 33:41.811
to demand a reexamination
on the part of the government

33:41.894 --> 33:45.982
to improve its penalties on scammers,
which will hopefully better in…

34:08.755 --> 34:10.089
Sergeant, please.

34:43.915 --> 34:44.832
Officer Lee?

34:46.584 --> 34:47.543
Officer Lee!

34:53.549 --> 34:55.885
Make sure we follow the signal
if it changes.

34:57.136 --> 34:58.971
Here's the chip. Track its location.

34:59.055 --> 34:59.889
Yes, sir.

35:09.273 --> 35:10.858
Here's where the GPS got picked up.

35:10.942 --> 35:12.985
- Update me on Blue Brown's location.
- I'll do my best.

35:13.069 --> 35:14.153
Okay, let's go!

35:28.334 --> 35:29.210
SERGEANT JO

35:55.069 --> 35:56.696
You're the man now!

35:57.196 --> 35:58.948
- Hold on.
- Who's this?

35:59.031 --> 35:59.866
CANCEL

36:14.422 --> 36:15.923
Confirming Blue Brown's location?

36:16.007 --> 36:17.717
Yes, we were able to narrow it down

36:17.800 --> 36:19.260
to Dongbu-dong and Gyeongin.

36:45.119 --> 36:47.663
- You're so good.
- Don't you think so? Oh!

36:47.747 --> 36:49.498
Whatever you're selling,
we're not interested.

36:49.582 --> 36:51.125
The old man's gonna sing a doozy!

36:54.337 --> 36:56.839
Come on, daddy.

37:20.780 --> 37:21.614
What?

37:24.367 --> 37:25.618
Oh shit.

37:26.369 --> 37:27.245
Lee Do,

37:27.995 --> 37:31.457
Se-yeong was sucked into a scam
she couldn't get out of, and she…

37:35.419 --> 37:36.629
Do you know…

37:38.714 --> 37:40.091
what pain feels like?

37:40.174 --> 37:41.801
This guy's lost it.

37:41.884 --> 37:45.054
- What a loser.
- I mean… what the fuck?

37:45.137 --> 37:47.556
Why the hell would you come
into someone else's private room

37:47.640 --> 37:49.600
and start talking shit?
Get the hell out of here.

37:49.684 --> 37:52.478
Seriously,
what's this lunatic even talking about?

37:52.561 --> 37:54.563
Someone call security.

37:54.647 --> 37:55.856
Security…

37:55.940 --> 37:58.359
Son Hyeon-seong, 34 years of age.

37:58.442 --> 38:01.696
Seven previous convictions,
including fraud and illegal gambling.

38:03.197 --> 38:05.783
Cheon Il-su, 35 years of age.

38:05.866 --> 38:08.286
Nine previous convictions,
including fraud and assault.

38:12.790 --> 38:13.624
Shit!

38:16.168 --> 38:18.004
You're killing my vibe.

38:19.380 --> 38:21.048
Who the hell are you, old man?

38:27.054 --> 38:30.224
Because people like you can
never begin to understand,

38:30.308 --> 38:33.477
because you lack
even a shred of human decency.

38:40.901 --> 38:42.361
My beautiful daughter…

38:44.572 --> 38:46.782
couldn't bear it for one more minute

38:46.866 --> 38:48.576
and took her own life today.

38:49.827 --> 38:54.749
What the hell does your dead daughter…
have to do with me or anyone here?

38:57.710 --> 38:59.879
I just saw my daughter at the morgue.

39:03.090 --> 39:05.634
Do not even dare
to insult the memory of her.

39:06.802 --> 39:10.473
Can someone just get this crazy old man
out of my fucking face?

39:10.556 --> 39:12.850
So what are you gonna do, pops?

39:12.933 --> 39:14.643
What do you want us to do?
Did we kill her?

39:14.727 --> 39:15.936
No, I don't think we did.

39:16.020 --> 39:18.147
So fuck off
while we go back to our party.

39:18.939 --> 39:21.025
What is it you want us to do, huh?

39:21.108 --> 39:22.526
What do you want from me?

39:23.694 --> 39:25.946
Apologize at my daughter's funeral.

39:26.614 --> 39:28.908
Apol… apologize? Shit.

39:29.492 --> 39:30.826
Is that what she asked for?

39:30.910 --> 39:31.786
Huh?

39:32.453 --> 39:35.164
Unless you wanna join your dead daughter
at the morgue,

39:35.915 --> 39:38.709
I'd suggest leaving now
before I really lose my temper.

39:39.752 --> 39:40.795
Get out of here.

39:42.004 --> 39:43.381
Get the fuck out!

39:43.464 --> 39:44.548
Go on.

39:45.800 --> 39:46.634
Now.

39:47.134 --> 39:49.553
What a fucking pain in the ass.
This guy ruined my buzz.

39:49.637 --> 39:51.180
Whoa, he's got a gun!

39:56.685 --> 39:58.604
What the fuck are you doing?!

39:58.687 --> 40:00.648
No!

40:01.732 --> 40:03.943
You leave us alone, you crazy bastard!

40:04.693 --> 40:07.696
- She was my little girl.
- Don't shoot! Don't shoot!

40:07.780 --> 40:10.241
She died,
and you don't feel a single thing.

40:12.368 --> 40:14.161
How utterly hopeless is that?

40:15.246 --> 40:16.956
Someone call the police!
